raph","text":"乃木坂だったからこそ\nこうして戻ってこれたのかな\nとも思いますヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～、珍しくちゃんとした\nブログを書いちゃいましたね～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしよっか（笑）←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁいっか_(┐「ε:)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう取り返しはつかんっっ(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのでぱしゃぱしゃtime(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はパンダに乗ってる写メっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前放送されたGIRL POP TVで花やしきに行った時に乗ったんです(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかしたら再放送もあるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/03/15/4229331/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠目の写メしかなかった(｡´･ω･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/03/15/4229331/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19歳がパンダとは\nなんともシュールです...(・・;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさーんっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はなんの日かわかります～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞こえないーっ(･ε･`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゅっ(((っ･ω･)っ♡です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会in幕張メッセ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},